{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/11651e8485348c1ae4738bb80cea3724.webp?t=1772110064\" width=609 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Choose your heroes, build powerful decks, and master tactical battles in a medieval fantasy world. Plan every move, position yourself strategically, use unique abilities, and discover new ways to overcome challenges in this intense strategy game.<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/add1030fa0b6ca16e60fb0a0d2ded494.webp?t=1772110064\" width=609 height=28 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/7d055085dcb4abf671fbe37e2669ee01.avif?t=1772110064\" width=609 height=174 /></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/4a04a8de1aebf039fab70b2634ba6020.poster.avif?t=1772110064\" width=698 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/4a04a8de1aebf039fab70b2634ba6020.webm?t=1772110064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/4a04a8de1aebf039fab70b2634ba6020.mp4?t=1772110064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/11651e8485348c1ae4738bb80cea3724.webp?t=1772110064\" width=609 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every run is a new experience! Combine heroes with unique abilities, from explosive strikes and area control to buffs, debuffs, and effects that can change the course of the battle. Explore synergies, unleash powerful combos, and discover unexpected tactics in every match. Each hero is special, and every team opens the door to completely new strategies.\u00a0<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/add1030fa0b6ca16e60fb0a0d2ded494.webp?t=1772110064\" width=609 height=28 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/640d6f54025fac9a0b84d34e2909b024.avif?t=1772110064\" width=609 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/c25fdaf8af4d42f766f84154b7438a57.poster.avif?t=1772110064\" width=1128 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/c25fdaf8af4d42f766f84154b7438a57.webm?t=1772110064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/c25fdaf8af4d42f766f84154b7438a57.mp4?t=1772110064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/11651e8485348c1ae4738bb80cea3724.webp?t=1772110064\" width=609 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Adapt your strategy in every match! Build unique teams and upgrade your heroes and decks with rewards earned at the end of each level. Each card is discarded after use, so think carefully about the right moment to play each one. And of course, choosing what goes into your deck wisely is essential. Combine abilities, refine your deck with each choice, and discover synergies capable of defining your victory or your defeat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/add1030fa0b6ca16e60fb0a0d2ded494.webp?t=1772110064\" width=609 height=28 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/8350daf5b34a6df4132e6b3ed0dc4223.avif?t=1772110064\" width=609 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/11651e8485348c1ae4738bb80cea3724.webp?t=1772110064\" width=609 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face tactical battles where every tile matters. Precise positioning and quick reading of the field are essential for survival. Each stage brings new layouts and challenges that change the flow of combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/0aef1a4b35dad3016e89d914faffb7d8.poster.avif?t=1772110064\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/0aef1a4b35dad3016e89d914faffb7d8.webm?t=1772110064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/0aef1a4b35dad3016e89d914faffb7d8.mp4?t=1772110064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enemies vary in behavior, with some rushing forward, others attacking from afar, and some applying group pressure. This makes each turn more dangerous than the last. With evolving threats trying to corner your heroes, planning every movement carefully is the key to mastering the battlefield.<br> \u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/add1030fa0b6ca16e60fb0a0d2ded494.webp?t=1772110064\" width=609 height=28 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3226660?t=1772110064","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/8449ac6d0302ec25b6a423d2d270aa9f114e3b1a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772110064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/85a1e6b795115196afb4aede49608c49afcd69f1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772110064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/85a1e6b795115196afb4aede49608c49afcd69f1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772110064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4374350,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226660/extras/11651e8485348c1ae4738bb80cea3724.webp?t=1772